    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Own Business Empire!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Business Simulator 2025</strong> is a business simulation game where you start from scratch and become a global giant. Make strategic decisions, grow your company, overcome financial challenges, and surpass your competitors! You'll develop all the skills needed to become a leader in the business world. Master marketing, production, and management processes while seizing opportunities and managing risks effectively.<br><br><strong>Company Formation</strong>:<br>Establish your company and take your first steps in the business world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/dc1809263219abf3f97db4dc7f317352.poster.avif?t=1755069196\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/dc1809263219abf3f97db4dc7f317352.webm?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/dc1809263219abf3f97db4dc7f317352.mp4?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Business Selection: Make a Difference with Strategy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide which industry to operate in. Create your business plan based on market analysis and competitive conditions. Choosing the right industry is the first step to success!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/8afaf0cf589f22da2d8929044d13b347.poster.avif?t=1755069196\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/8afaf0cf589f22da2d8929044d13b347.webm?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/8afaf0cf589f22da2d8929044d13b347.mp4?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Production Management</strong>:<br>Analyze your products, launch them on the market, and meet demand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/f7c422b44194cbcc37d5f973f279cccb.poster.avif?t=1755069196\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/f7c422b44194cbcc37d5f973f279cccb.webm?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/f7c422b44194cbcc37d5f973f279cccb.mp4?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Shop Expansion and Automation: Continuous Revenue Stream</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop and automate your operations by hiring more employees. Grow your operations and enjoy generating continuous income. Turn your shop into a money-making machine with strategic investments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/aff15e75ced85206265f552435e4b1ac.poster.avif?t=1755069196\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/aff15e75ced85206265f552435e4b1ac.webm?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/aff15e75ced85206265f552435e4b1ac.mp4?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>You Set the Path to the Top</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the future of your company with every decision. Develop strategies, seize opportunities, and master the complex dynamics of the business world to outsmart your competitors!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Own Business Empire!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Business Simulator 2025</strong> is a business simulation game where you start from scratch and become a global giant. Make strategic decisions, grow your company, overcome financial challenges, and surpass your competitors! You'll develop all the skills needed to become a leader in the business world. Master marketing, production, and management processes while seizing opportunities and managing risks effectively.<br><br><strong>Company Formation</strong>:<br>Establish your company and take your first steps in the business world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/dc1809263219abf3f97db4dc7f317352.poster.avif?t=1755069196\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/dc1809263219abf3f97db4dc7f317352.webm?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/dc1809263219abf3f97db4dc7f317352.mp4?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Business Selection: Make a Difference with Strategy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide which industry to operate in. Create your business plan based on market analysis and competitive conditions. Choosing the right industry is the first step to success!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/8afaf0cf589f22da2d8929044d13b347.poster.avif?t=1755069196\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/8afaf0cf589f22da2d8929044d13b347.webm?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/8afaf0cf589f22da2d8929044d13b347.mp4?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Production Management</strong>:<br>Analyze your products, launch them on the market, and meet demand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/f7c422b44194cbcc37d5f973f279cccb.poster.avif?t=1755069196\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/f7c422b44194cbcc37d5f973f279cccb.webm?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/f7c422b44194cbcc37d5f973f279cccb.mp4?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Shop Expansion and Automation: Continuous Revenue Stream</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop and automate your operations by hiring more employees. Grow your operations and enjoy generating continuous income. Turn your shop into a money-making machine with strategic investments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/aff15e75ced85206265f552435e4b1ac.poster.avif?t=1755069196\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/aff15e75ced85206265f552435e4b1ac.webm?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098060/extras/aff15e75ced85206265f552435e4b1ac.mp4?t=1755069196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>You Set the Path to the Top</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the future of your company with every decision. Develop strategies, seize opportunities, and master the complex dynamics of the business world to outsmart your competitors!</p>",
